<title>FRANCE: Lyonnaise, Suez merger excellent plan - Monod.</title>
<headline>Lyonnaise, Suez merger excellent plan - Monod.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The aim of merging utilities group Lyonnaise des Eaux and holding company Cie de Suez is an &quot;excellent plan&quot;, Lyonnaise head Jerome Monod said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
